But do you know what the smallest unit of </span><a class="rounded-xs focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-ring hover:underline max-w-full text-[length:inherit] font-[inherit] text-brand" data-state="closed" data-slot="hover-card-trigger" href="/search?q=%24BNB">$<!-- -->BNB</a><span class="font-chirp max-w-full whitespace-pre-wrap break-words text-inherit text-[length:inherit] font-inherit"> is?

